          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While Israel dwelt in Shittim the people began to play the harlot with the daughters of Moab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These invited the people to the sacrifices of their gods, and the people ate, and bowed down to their gods. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Israel yoked himself to Baal of Peor. And the anger of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was kindled against Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Take all the chiefs of the people, and hang them in the sun before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that the fierce anger of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " may turn away from Israel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said to the judges of Israel, “Every one of you slay his men who have yoked themselves to Baal of Peor.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, one of the people of Israel came and brought a Midianite woman to his family, in the sight of Moses and in the sight of the whole congregation of the people of Israel, while they were weeping at the door of the tent of meeting. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Phinehas the son of Eleazar, son of Aaron the priest, saw it, he rose and left the congregation, and took a spear in his hand ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and went after the man of Israel into the inner room, and pierced both of them, the man of Israel and the woman, through her body. Thus the plague was stayed from the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless those that died by the plague were twenty-four thousand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phinehas the son of Eleazar, son of Aaron the priest, has turned back my wrath from the people of Israel, in that he was jealous with my jealousy among them, so that I did not consume the people of Israel in my jealousy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore say, ‘Behold, I give to him my covenant of peace; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and it shall be to him, and to his descendants after him, the covenant of a perpetual priesthood, because he was jealous for his God, and made atonement for the people of Israel.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The name of the slain man of Israel, who was slain with the Midianite woman, was Zimri the son of Salu, head of a fathers' house belonging to the Simeonites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the name of the Midianite woman who was slain was Cozbi the daughter of Zur, who was the head of the people of a fathers' house in Midian.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Harass the Midianites, and smite them; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for they have harassed you with their wiles, with which they beguiled you in the matter of Peor, and in the matter of Cozbi, the daughter of the prince of Midian, their sister, who was slain on the day of the plague on account of Peor.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
